---
title: SecureCapita - Authenticated Request & JWT Refresh
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant NG as Angular Service
    participant INT as HTTP Interceptor
    participant FILT as JWT Authorization Filter
    participant TP as JWT Token Provider
    participant CTRL as Protected Controller
    participant DB as MySQL

    Note over NG,DB: Normal authenticated request
    U->>NG: Trigger action (e.g. load customers)
    NG->>INT: HTTP request
    INT->>INT: Attach Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>
    INT->>FILT: GET /customer/list
    FILT->>TP: validate token + extract authorities
    alt Token valid
        TP-->>FILT: authentication + GrantedAuthorities
        FILT->>CTRL: forward request (SecurityContext set)
        CTRL->>DB: query data
        CTRL-->>NG: 200 OK + payload
    else Token expired / invalid
        FILT-->>INT: 401 Unauthorized
        Note over NG,TP: Refresh sequence
        NG->>FILT: GET /user/refresh/token<br/>(Bearer refreshToken)
        FILT->>TP: validate refresh token
        TP-->>FILT: new access token
        FILT-->>NG: 200 OK + new accessToken
        NG->>INT: retry original request with new token
        INT->>CTRL: GET /customer/list
        CTRL-->>NG: 200 OK + payload
    end
